oh-my-pi (OMP Runtime)
----------------------
This repository vendors [oh-my-pi](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi) as a
Git submodule at `omp-patch/vendor/oh-my-pi`, pinned in `omp-patch/upstream.json`.
Studio applies an overlay and a small set of seam patches to that tree in order
to expose a typed Studio Bridge (`omp --mode studio-host`).

oh-my-pi is a fork of Pi by Mario Zechner.

